  "structure": {
    "block_count": 77,
    "blocks": [
      {
        "block_id": "block_000000",
        "block_index": 0,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h1",
        "text": "Should You Eat Organic Foods When You're Pregnant?",
        "text_sha256": "f92d2c5be9cd1732a1ddaebed830afad4ca19cc7b3fc7d7a835040bc5c2a7806",
        "word_count": 8
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000001",
        "block_index": 1,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Updates to copy, sources, and formatting.",
        "text_sha256": "2bf448333081ffc8549a45a6c4b7fc711ee4b93575f0fffd3c4a6212c13581c2",
        "word_count": 6
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000002",
        "block_index": 2,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Organic Diet During Pregnancy",
        "text_sha256": "3e40c75a9cacc92f9173faa7a788c78810631aa2c78effafa06c244e72807505",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000003",
        "block_index": 3,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Learn what organic really means — and whether organic foods are really worth the extra cost during pregnancy.",
        "text_sha256": "c727d288b8820d71aac694f0ba7b4bec6395502d022d0eb5d66c62038d17b2b1",
        "word_count": 18
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000004",
        "block_index": 4,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Now that you're pregnant, you may be wondering whether you should opt for organic foods. Organics, after all, are more expensive than non-organic, or conventional, food — but naturally you want to do everything possible to give your baby the best start to life. So is buying organic during pregnancy worth it?",
        "text_sha256": "1a75773ebcd2dc86c0419c85773367c2b9b892b892dc7e65e628709aa93084b5",
        "word_count": 52
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000005",
        "block_index": 5,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Like every debate, there are pros and cons — and the organic-vs.-conventional-food controversy is far from being settled.",
        "text_sha256": "8f530c5b76c3d9b243dc5bcd1f08d432ba94a92d2624149173d9b9d78079818c",
        "word_count": 18
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000006",
        "block_index": 6,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Organic foods tend to be less harmful to the environment and result in less exposure to some pesticides, according to the American Academy of Pediatrics (AAP) . But there's no proof that eating an organic diet has any meaningful nutritional benefits over a traditional diet when you're pregnant (and when you're not).",
        "text_sha256": "18487f01fd83f0eb46ebf58cccc97bc53efb83f02e0ad6cfe3813db3aede5fd4",
        "word_count": 52
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000007",
        "block_index": 7,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Still, does that mean buying organic isn't a wise way to spend your money? Not necessarily. Here are a few things to know about including organic food in your pregnancy diet .",
        "text_sha256": "2a8b7723f60e77beee860b3c1328c5fe7916f8319ad091313ef07474c82ac7f8",
        "word_count": 32
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000008",
        "block_index": 8,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Key Takeaways",
        "text_sha256": "cc3f7f0f4513969e418b56fb93ec0876fd96dd6498395b04301f70dbddff8a45",
        "word_count": 2
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000009",
        "block_index": 9,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Organic isn't more nutritious. While there are fewer traditional pesticides, additives, and antibiotics in organic foods, they aren't proven to be better for you.",
        "text_sha256": "b6759ad5fbe856fb0a47161ba4433c1ce996ab4954128a203a0ed397041a6902",
        "word_count": 24
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000010",
        "block_index": 10,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Some organic produce may be worth it. A few fruits and veggies have higher synthetic pesticide levels, so buying organic may be a smart choice for you (though remember that they use approved organic pesticides). But for most things, conventional is completely fine too.",
        "text_sha256": "258649d7f452ed38137843aa8b25e8d6a01d58237985cfbf9542289dca983a34",
        "word_count": 44
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000011",
        "block_index": 11,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Eat the rainbow and be safe too. Whether you pick organic or regular items, aim for a colorful, healthy diet, cook meat thoroughly, and wash produce carefully.",
        "text_sha256": "f74c5b909412d515a104c9f8a26145a22af0c2202190b3732032b9bf9bc6cc89",
        "word_count": 27
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000012",
        "block_index": 12,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "What does \"organic\" mean?",
        "text_sha256": "97a7206f93d54f143c5f5e5effc57526f21656b95225280afefb28a695f2861f",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000013",
        "block_index": 13,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "The U.S. Department of Agriculture (USDA) has a set of standards that food labeled \"organic\" must meet, regardless of whether the food is grown in the United States or elsewhere. These standards stipulate the manner in which such food is grown, handled, and processed. By definition, organic food:",
        "text_sha256": "2ad94ef14f65b62472e954ecd916acde11f3dd9be6304364a607b2f8c1e101e1",
        "word_count": 48
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000014",
        "block_index": 14,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Uses only approved organic pesticides",
        "text_sha256": "51d2e4075cf0482bb93bcc9ee3701791189babd5a2420c35122c497804a63961",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000015",
        "block_index": 15,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Doesn't use toxic or synthetic fertilizers",
        "text_sha256": "fd908428d1ceb4d09024cd4971726b18590685e83a41185e50a36ac7a571da6e",
        "word_count": 6
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000016",
        "block_index": 16,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Doesn't use toxic or synthetic weed-killers",
        "text_sha256": "402a7342dbed23357abb3c3efab2a88f43079b0b6e056c19b9b5b23483d77a91",
        "word_count": 6
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000017",
        "block_index": 17,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Can't be genetically modified",
        "text_sha256": "3ab3c2a93426949bd3f58972311d3c261e2dd95f01431a217c169b56b3d75887",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000018",
        "block_index": 18,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Doesn't receive hormones or antibiotics (for chicken, beef, and pork)",
        "text_sha256": "bd6640ac9cb3b8ceeb3b909235d6667ed713091bf55aa49359b967872a6aa90b",
        "word_count": 10
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000019",
        "block_index": 19,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "The USDA Organic Seal guidelines are based on the percentage of organic ingredients they have and can be a bit tricky to interpret. For example:",
        "text_sha256": "181bca565ad619d74ddd865081998ea06d64336e93590cf4fe7ee9919acc4ec3",
        "word_count": 25
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000020",
        "block_index": 20,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Foods labeled \"100% organic\" must contain only certified organic ingredients",
        "text_sha256": "ea5613f3f47c6247d1b06e34bf4c8cce426248989b4ae234af016a6318f07f99",
        "word_count": 10
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000021",
        "block_index": 21,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Foods labeled \"organic\" must be made with at least 95% organically produced ingredients (excluding water and salt)",
        "text_sha256": "f419b8f2c4c231f87c828d9d01029d54c6ad2cd043f845ed8db1a4f6c3cf328d",
        "word_count": 17
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000022",
        "block_index": 22,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Foods labeled \"made with organic ingredients\" must be made with 70% organic ingredients",
        "text_sha256": "eed1bb020c0efe464f919cd9b8d99357c1f66f73ad3bc9db236584461df72dcf",
        "word_count": 13
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000023",
        "block_index": 23,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Foods that are only labeled organic on the ingredient side label, not the main label, are made with less than 50% organic ingredients",
        "text_sha256": "1e0ada1408938664268e565b841ced7b6b371bf83c15ef2c3c1550d6dfa07da5",
        "word_count": 23
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000024",
        "block_index": 24,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Want more healthy eating tips and yummy snack ideas? Download the What to Expect app, your trusted pregnancy guide for every meal (and milestone!) along the way.",
        "text_sha256": "243fd5feecc89d6cc63b96054dd18cdde9966503036b20127013a5c5dd00fe9a",
        "word_count": 27
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000025",
        "block_index": 25,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Why pregnant mothers should consider eating organic",
        "text_sha256": "d5726b1857d84c6a2163befbe79150810b9ed483b8292590210ef1bf268ef117",
        "word_count": 7
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000026",
        "block_index": 26,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "The research is ongoing — and controversial — but some studies have shown that organic foods may help you avoid:",
        "text_sha256": "85a855430f900a8731f237ea62f71b4d8c13b155c96cc790b4cc9d80c9fd2862",
        "word_count": 20
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000027",
        "block_index": 27,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Pesticides. Research indicates that eating organic foods decreases the amount of synthetic pesticides we consume, but there's still more to learn about the effects of those pesticides on humans (and organic foods still may be produced with organic pesticides). The World Health Organization (WHO) and Environmental Protection Agency (EPA), for example, take different stances on whether the popular weed-killer glyphosate is carcinogenic for people.",
        "text_sha256": "c33ac6982dde4df448966dcf9a691d387a837e86febe1946268b982caef7945f",
        "word_count": 64
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000028",
        "block_index": 28,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Antibiotics. More research needs to be done on the long-term effects of antibiotics given to animals and then consumed by people. But the risk is that, over a long period of time, certain bacteria in the animals we eat will become immune to the antibiotics we routinely feed them. If people, in turn, eat improperly cooked meat and become ill with this antibiotic-resistant bacteria, it may not be easy or possible to cure the infection with antibiotics. USDA-certified organic meat does not contain antibiotics.",
        "text_sha256": "8e9a74506be24f87596420f406816a9006438563d5109ffbb66b574580be8184",
        "word_count": 84
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000029",
        "block_index": 29,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Additives. When buying ready-made foods, choosing organic varieties often means avoiding artificial colorings, flavorings, and preservatives. There's been a longstanding debate about whether and how additives and preservatives may affect pregnant women, babies, and children, but some research suggests that it may be better to limit them during pregnancy.",
        "text_sha256": "17cc33c3d229e827984a22ee45b982d0ec7bdc5120f4fb1ae65bc2310b806bd3",
        "word_count": 49
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000030",
        "block_index": 30,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "The downsides of eating organic",
        "text_sha256": "3692d438c9d27e71fcda717131b8a19fa8cc2aedd9209252efc2b873a7bc736e",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000031",
        "block_index": 31,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "In addition to cost — organics can be up to double the price of conventional foods — there can be other downsides to eating organic, including:",
        "text_sha256": "23919fa33be7f45b035e750acdcfbf9127e2b95b369f59d32452e77087a9f85a",
        "word_count": 26
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000032",
        "block_index": 32,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "They can have a shorter shelf life. Preservatives are meant to, well, preserve. That means their shelf life is much longer than organic products. Bread and other staples will often have earlier expiration dates if they're preservative-free.",
        "text_sha256": "096e729ab3222932e0a4778fce687e22733883860fa710ffca11f95e48c460ac",
        "word_count": 37
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000033",
        "block_index": 33,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "They aren't necessarily tastier. Think organic produce always tastes better than conventional produce? That may not be the case. One analysis of organically and conventionally grown vegetables didn't report any significant difference in taste quality for most produce — with the exception of tomatoes, where conventional surprisingly scored higher.",
        "text_sha256": "c6b5990100860eac41392bae04562a1a587050a575623c1d0295ed7eecd7fd46",
        "word_count": 49
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000034",
        "block_index": 34,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "They aren't necessarily healthier. \"Organic\" doesn't necessarily mean more nutritious. Some research shows that people mistake organic foods for lower-calorie foods, and therefore, believe they can eat them more often. However, organic foods can still be high in calories and sweeteners, so they won't necessarily help with following a healthy diet during pregnancy. Check the labels: The overall nutritional value of your choice is more important than whether its ingredients are organic.",
        "text_sha256": "ed56452030ab74a1b415497b66191463d8b7b0c3537e6577b95c904d0296319f",
        "word_count": 72
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000035",
        "block_index": 35,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "When to shop — and when to skip — organic",
        "text_sha256": "6233c686fff3c0a74f90e0ce0b3d4edd49999f5631c107a7991cdcb565aa6023",
        "word_count": 10
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000036",
        "block_index": 36,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Experts stress that choosing more nutrient-dense fruits and vegetables of any kind is key, and you can rest easier knowing that pesticide levels in foods tested by the USDA and FDA remain well below established safety limits.",
        "text_sha256": "3e5ad2540d3de4bad1f60050bbb68b72666d3ebec5ac49b6df8987d1c665eaae",
        "word_count": 37
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000037",
        "block_index": 37,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "But if you're looking to eat more \"green,\" here are the foods deemed to have the most traditional pesticides in them, followed by those with the least:",
        "text_sha256": "a499bb9adbbb0970431f8fe2e2c30e79eda03f54dc797cc741043930351ab2bb",
        "word_count": 27
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000038",
        "block_index": 38,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "Foods to buy organic",
        "text_sha256": "ba83ed40079ba2b2a588b842f8aad35bfa0628edc4ae7465ea2d5830dbe188b1",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000039",
        "block_index": 39,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Apples",
        "text_sha256": "007f1d79a45f16841559163c2b80f037f03b3c5a644764ae9559a2cbed78218d",
        "word_count": 1
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000040",
        "block_index": 40,
        "block_type": "li",
